格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Public distribution surface for jarvis — local-first code intelligence MCP server (SCIP navigation + Zoekt search). Installer, Claude Code / Codex / Cursor plugins, and prebuilt binaries.","id":"gh:1324712052","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"jarvis-index","slug":"jarvis-intelligence/jarvis-index","topics":["ai-agents","ai-tools","claude-code","code-intelligence","code-navigation","code-search","codebase-analysis","codex","cursor","developer-tools","dsh-plugin","llm-tools","local-first","mcp","mcp-server","model-context-protocol","scip","skills","static-analysis","zoekt"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Public distribution surface for jarvis — local-first code intelligence MCP server (SCIP navigation +"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" Zoekt search). Installer, Claude Code / Codex / Cursor plugins, and prebuilt binaries."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"**Local-first code intelligence for coding agents.** Index your own repositories with SCIP and\nZoekt"},{"id":"p2s2","text":", then let the agent ask structural questions — *who calls this?*, *where is this defined?* —\ninstea"},{"id":"p2s3","text":"d of guessing from grep."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Everything runs on your machine. No code leaves it, no telemetry, no account."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"This repo is the **public distribution surface**: the Homebrew tap and formula, the optional\nlanguag"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"e-tooling installer, the plugins, the binary release assets, and the issue tracker. It holds\nno sour"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ce — see Why this repo exists."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Ten MCP tools, exposed to any MCP client:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| | Tool | Answers |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| **Navigate** | `goToDefinition` | Where is `X` defined? |\n| | `findReferences` | Everywhere `X` is"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" used |\n| | `callHierarchy` | What calls `X`, and what `X` calls |\n| | `typeHierarchy` | Super/subty"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"pes of `X` |\n| | `documentSymbols` | Every symbol in a file |\n| **Search** | `searchCode` | Lexical "},{"id":"p8s4","text":"search across indexed repos (Zoekt) |\n| | `semanticSearch` | Registered for compatibility; unavailab"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"le in the Homebrew distribution |\n| **Scope** | `blastRadius` | Which other indexed repos depend on "},{"id":"p8s6","text":"this package |\n| | `indexRepo` | Builds an index for a local git repo and returns immediately for po"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"lling |\n| | `getIndexStatus` | Is this repo indexed, and is the index stale? |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Plus three agent skills that ship with the plugin: **`jarvis-setup`** (onboarding),\n**`jarvis-use`**"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" (steers the agent toward structural queries over grep), and **`jarvis-issues`**\n(files well-formed "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"agent toward structural queries over grep), and **`jarvis-issues`**\n(files well-formed bug reports)."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Full signatures and return shapes: `plugin/skills/jarvis-use/references/tool-roster.md`."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Then install the plugin below to register `jarvis-server` and install the agent skills."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Install as a plugin"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The plugin bundles the MCP registration and all three skills, so there is no manual `mcp add`."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Client | How |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| **Claude Code** | `/plugin marketplace add jarvis-intelligence/jarvis-index`\n`/plugin install jarv"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"is@jarvis` |\n| **Codex CLI** | `codex plugin marketplace add https://github.com/jarvis-intelligence/"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"jarvis-index --ref main`\n`codex plugin add jarvis` |\n| **Cursor** | Dashboard → Plugins → Add Market"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"place → Import from Repo *(Teams/Enterprise)*\nor clone and `ln -s \"$PWD/jarvis-index/plugin\" ~/.curs"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"or/plugins/local/jarvis` |\n| **Other MCP clients** | Point them at the stdio command `jarvis-server`"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"/plugins/local/jarvis` |\n| **Other MCP clients** | Point them at the stdio command `jarvis-server` |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The plugin launches the Homebrew-installed `jarvis-server`. If needed, install optional language-spe"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"cific SCIP tooling afterward with the setup skill's `--only` commands."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Details, Homebrew limits, and privacy notes: `plugin/README.md`."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **macOS or Linux with Homebrew/Linuxbrew.** Windows is not supported.\n- `jarvis 0.11.0` installed "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"by `brew install jarvis-intelligence/jarvis/jarvis`.\n- `java` on `PATH` only if you index Java/Kotli"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" install jarvis-intelligence/jarvis/jarvis`.\n- `java` on `PATH` only if you index Java/Kotlin repos."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Language support"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"One language per index — a polyglot repo indexes only its plurality language."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Language | Indexer | Notes |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| TypeScript / JavaScript | `scip-typescript` | |\n| Python | `scip-python` | |\n| Swift | `scip-swift"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"` | macOS arm64 only; pass `--scheme` if the Xcode project has several |\n| Java / Kotlin | `scip-jav"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"a` | Android/Gradle projects and repos off the pinned Kotlin version are published **search-only** —"},{"id":"p25s4","text":" lexical search works, SCIP navigation does not, and `semanticSearch` is unavailable in the Homebrew"},{"id":"p25s5","text":" works, SCIP navigation does not, and `semanticSearch` is unavailable in the Homebrew distribution |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Why this repo exists"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"jarvis's development repo is private, and GitHub serves raw files and release assets **only to\nviewe"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"rs of the owning repo**. An unauthenticated `curl` against a private repo's `setup.sh` 404s —\nwhich "},{"id":"p27s3","text":"is every real user. So every user-facing install path lives here, in public:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- optional language-tooling installer, fetchable by anyone\n- the Homebrew tap and formula\n- the Clau"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"de Code / Codex / Cursor plugins\n- the `scip` and `zoekt` binaries, as GitHub release assets\n- the i"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"dex / Cursor plugins\n- the `scip` and `zoekt` binaries, as GitHub release assets\n- the issue tracker"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Repo layout"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Editing this repo"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Path | Rule |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| `setup.sh` | **Never edit here.** The optional language-tooling installer is published automatical"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ly from the development repo and overwritten on the next release. Fix it upstream. |\n| everything el"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"se | Source of truth is **here** — edit directly. |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Any change under `plugin/` must bump the `version` in **all three** plugin manifests, to the same\nva"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"lue, or it reaches nobody: `plugin/.claude-plugin/plugin.json`,\n`plugin/.cursor-plugin/plugin.json`,"},{"id":"p34s3","text":" `.codex-plugin/plugin.json`. Plugin `0.11.1` versions independently of the Homebrew jarvis CLI."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Full conventions: `docs/code-standards.md`."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Docs"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"overview ·\narchitecture ·\ncodebase summary ·\nstandards ·\npublishing ·\nroadmap"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Links"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- **Issues / feature requests:** <https://github.com/jarvis-intelligence/jarvis-index/issues>\n- **Ch"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"angelog:** <https://github.com/jarvis-intelligence/jarvis-index/releases/tag/v0.11.1>\n- **License:**"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"log:** <https://github.com/jarvis-intelligence/jarvis-index/releases/tag/v0.11.1>\n- **License:** MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
